%% TRIP-010 Flight search results
%% From the search form to the chosen trip. Steps are labelled with requirement IDs.
flowchart TD
    A[Search form: Från, Till, Utresa, Hemresa, Resenärer] -->|Sök| B{All filled in, different airports? R1}
    B -- no --> C[Red field and message, no search R1]
    C --> A
    B -- yes --> D["/flyg?fran=…&till=…&utresa=…&hemresa=…&resenarer=… R2"]
    D --> E{Valid search, airports exist?}
    E -- no --> F[Empty form: Sökningen saknar något]
    E -- yes --> G[Server: departures of the route, minus those that have left R4, R10, R11]
    G --> H[Skeleton cards, status Söker flyg… R3]
    H -->|1–4 s| I[Flight cards and number, status N flyg hittades R3–R5]
    I -->|click card| J[Details: flight number, airports, date, total, Välj R6]
    I -->|Sortera på Pris / Avgångstid| I
    J -->|Välj| K{Return trip? R8}
    K -- no --> M[Din resa: flight and total R9]
    K -- yes --> L[Return flights, chosen outbound above R8]
    L -->|Ändra utresa: clears the return| I
    L -->|Välj| M
    M -->|Ändra utresa| I
    M -->|Ändra hemresa| L
    I -->|change the form, Sök| D
